OL,3,AMurder investigation after body found
OL,4,Ain van on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a body was found in a
OL,8,Fvan that was on fire.
OL,10,FEmergency Services were called to Gas
OL,11,FWorks Lane in Prestatyn, Flintshire, at
OL,12,Fabout 23:30 BST on Sunday after reports
OL,13,Fof the van ablaze.
OL,15,FThe identity of the person is unknown,
OL,16,Fand Det Supt Chris Bell said: "Officers
OL,17,Fare working at pace to identify the
OL,18,Fperson."
OL,20,FA police cordon is in place, as
OL,21,Finvestigations continue.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
